<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglovaal talks continue, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Anglovaal talks continue, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglovaal Ltd on Tuesday advised holders of Anglovaal and Avmin securities that discussions, which may affect the price at which their securities are traded, are continuing.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to continue to exercise caution when dealing in these secutities.</p>
<p>The cautionary follows an earlier cautionary announcement on November 19.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
